        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Appliance Repair Employee classification requires that an employee shall be capable of and regularly engaged in repairing and reconditioning gas appliances brought into the repair shop. Performance of the duties assigned under this classification for a total of ninety (90) days automatically qualifies an employee.",
